"<p>Messages classified as spam are not marked as read.<br />"
"Spam messages are moved into the folder named <i>%1</i>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Narichten, de as Warven gellt, warrt nich as leest markeert.<br />"
"Warven-Narichten warrt na den <i>%1</i> Orner verschaven.</p>"

#. +> future stable
#: antispam-virus/antispamwizard.cpp:617
msgid ""
"<p>Messages classified as spam are not marked as read.<br />"
"Spam messages are not moved into a certain folder.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Narichten, de as Warven gellt, warrt nich as leest markeert.<br />"
"Warven-Narichten warrt nich na en fastleggt Orner verschaven.</p>"

